  "pli-tv-bu-vb-ss1:5.8.1": "Vmv 1.264: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Vatthinti aṅgajātasīsacchādakacammaṁ</i>, “<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Vatthi</i>: the skin covering the head of the penis.” ",
